title: The Death of Leonida Bissolati
subtitle: He will be greatly missed.
view-if: year == 1920 and month >= 5
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: bissolati_dead = 1;
tags: event
new-page: true
go-to: pm if prime_minister = "Bissolati"; not_pm if prime_minister != "Bissolati"

= The Loss Of A Man

@pm
face-image: img/portraits/Leonida_Bissolati.jpeg

Prime Minister Leonida Bissolati has died while in office, deciding to do surgery due to his old age, unfortunately he would catch a post-operative infection and would die shortly after..

Regardless of political affiliation, he will be missed.  A commited <span style="color: #008C45;">rep</span><span style="color: #dddddd;">ubli/span><span style="color: #CD212A;">can/span> and <span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">social/span>-<span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">democrat/span>, this represents the weakening of <span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">social/span>-<span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">democracy/span> in the PSRI.

Now, we have to deal with the political side of his death, getting to choose a new Prime Minister. The PSRI are heavily pushing for us to support Bonomi, Bissolati's successor, as Prime Minister. However, we can support our own candidates, or others.

- @turati_pm: Filippo Turati ([+ psi_name +]) for Prime Minister.
- @bonomi_pm: Ivanoe Bonomi (PSRI) for Prime Minister.
- @de_gasperi_pm: Let Alcide De Gasperi of the PPI become Prime Minister.
- @orlando_pm: Let Vittorio Emanuele Orlando of the LDR become Prime Minister.

@turati_pm
view-if: not reformists_defect
on-arrival: prime_minister = "Turati"; prime_minister_party = psi_name; psri_relation -= 5; ldr_relation -= 5 if centre_left_coalition; ppi_relation -= 5 if socialist_catholic_coalition
subtitle: The PSRI argue for their own successor, while the [? if centre_left_coalition : LDR and UL ?][? if socialist_catholic_coalition : PPI ?] argue for their own man to lead.

Our coalition partners are reluctant to accept the new Prime Minister, but they do not make loud objections.

- @memento_mori

@bonomi_pm
on-arrival: prime_minister = "Bonomi"; prime_minister_party = "PSRI"; psri_relation += 5; ldr_relation -= 3 if centre_left_coalition; ppi_relation -= 3 if socialist_catholic_coalition
subtitle: The PSRI claims allowing Bonomi to lead is the right thing to do.

Our coalition partners on the right are reluctant to accept the new Prime Minister, but they do not make loud objections. The PSRI thanks us for our backing, and we see an improvement in relations.

- @memento_mori

@de_gasperi_pm
on-arrival: prime_minister = "De Gasperi"; prime_minister_party = "PPI"; psri_relation -= 3; ppi_relation += 5
view-if: socialist_catholic_coalition
subtitle: The PPI claims it is their turn...

The PPI is grateful that we have supported De Gasperi for Prime Minister, while the PSRI are disappointed at our choice.

- @memento_mori

@orlando_pm
on-arrival: prime_minister = "Orlando"; prime_minister_party = ldr_name; psri_relation -= 3; ldr_relation += 5
view-if: centre_left_coalition
subtitle: The LDR would prefer a moderate to led the country.

The LDR is grateful that we have supported Orlando for Prime Minister, while the PSRI are disappointed at our choice.

- @memento_mori

@memento_mori
title: Memento Mori..

He will be missed.

@not_pm
face-image: img/portraits/Leonida_Bissolati.jpeg

Leonida Bissolati, leader of the PSRI, has died due to a post-operative infection after he received a surgery due to his old age.

Regardless of political affiliation, he will be missed.  A commited <span style="color: #008C45;">rep</span><span style="color: #dddddd;">ubli/span><span style="color: #CD212A;">can/span> and <span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">social/span>-<span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">democrat/span>, this represents the weakening of <span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">social/span>-<span style="color: [+ psri_colour +];">democracy/span> in the PSRI. 

In the political side of things, Bonomi has taken  over most of the PSRI due to Bissolati's death and opposition to Bonomi is slowly dying out. 

 @memento_mori
